| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---- |
| **Fixed Window Counter**            | Count requests in fixed time buckets            | `count`, `windowStart`                    | Allow if `count < limit`                               | If `floor(t/W) != currentWindow` → reset `count = 0`      | O(1)     |                                     |      |
| **Sliding Window Log**              | Count requests in last W ms (exact)             | `timestamps[]`                            | Allow if `                                             | timestamps ∈ (t-W, t]                                     | < limit` | Remove all `ti ≤ t-W`, then add `t` | O(N) |
| **Token Bucket**                    | Tokens refill over time, request consumes token | `tokens`, `lastRefillTime`                | Allow if `tokens ≥ 1`                                  | `tokens = min(C, tokens + (t-last)*r)` then `tokens -= 1` | O(1)     |                                     |      |
| ** Leaky Bucket**                   | Queue + constant drain rate                     | `queueSize`                               | Allow if `queueSize < capacity`                        | `queueSize = max(0, queueSize - drainRate * Δt) + 1`      | O(1)     |                                     |      |
